@host = http://localhost:3010

### List all trails
GET {{host}}/trails

### Add a trail
POST {{host}}/trails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Colorado",
  "miles": 130.8,
  "difficulty": "hard"
}

### Add another one
POST {{host}}/trails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bear Lake Loop",
  "miles": 0.8,
  "difficulty": "easy"
}

### Rejected — name too short, miles out of range, unknown difficulty
POST {{host}}/trails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "X",
  "miles": 2000,
  "difficulty": "brutal"
}

### Get one trail (paste an id from the list above)
GET {{host}}/trails/paste-an-id-here
